{"seq":16,"slug":"multiplayer-netcode","title":"多人游戏网络同步","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"多人游戏网络同步\">多人游戏网络同步</h1><p>把同一个游戏世界同时呈现在几台甚至上万台相距遥远的机器上，让每个玩家都觉得自己看到的是&quot;真相&quot;——这是多人游戏最反直觉的工程。光速是硬上限：信号横跨太平洋的单程就要几十毫秒，而一帧只有 16 毫秒。于是网络同步从来不是&quot;把数据传过去&quot;，而是&quot;在信息永远滞后、永远可能丢失、对端永远可能撒谎的前提下，编织出一致且流畅的共享幻觉&quot;。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿着一条从原理到落地的主线，分四章把这门手艺拆开讲。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」先建立思考框架：为什么同步本质上是延迟、一致性、公平三者间的权衡；游戏世界由谁说了算（权威模型与拓扑）；以及延迟、带宽、抖动这三个物理约束如何决定后面所有设计的上限。没有这一章的概念坐标系，后面的技法都会变成零散的招式。</p>\n<p>第二章「同步模型」回答最核心的架构问题：网络上到底传什么。锁步只传输入、让每台机器各自跑出相同结果；状态同步由服务器广播世界快照；客户端预测则让本地先行一步、再与服务器协调。这三种模型不是优劣排序，而是针对不同游戏品类（RTS、FPS、MMO、格斗）的不同答案。</p>\n<p>第三章「核心技法」是让前述模型在真实抖动网络下&quot;好玩&quot;的关键补丁：插值与外推让远端实体的运动顺滑；延迟补偿让高 ping 玩家也能打中移动目标；回滚则把预测与协调推到极致，成为格斗游戏的事实标准。这些技法彼此咬合，常常组合使用。</p>\n<p>第四章「基础设施」落到工程地面：可靠 UDP 与 QUIC 这类传输层如何在不可靠网络上造出可控的可靠性；匹配、中继与 NAT 穿透如何把两台躲在路由器后的机器连起来；以及当对端不可信时，如何用服务器权威、加密与反作弊守住游戏的公平。</p>\n<p>四章层层递进：基础给出约束，模型给出架构，技法让架构可玩，基础设施让它能在真实互联网上运行。读完你会明白，所谓&quot;网络流畅&quot;从来不是网快，而是一连串精心设计的欺骗与纠错。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"netcode-fundamentals","title":"网络同步基础与挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/netcode-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authority-models","title":"权威模型与网络拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/authority-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"latency-bandwidth","title":"延迟、带宽与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/latency-bandwidth"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-models","title":"同步模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lockstep-deterministic","title":"锁步与确定性模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/lockstep-deterministic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"state-snapshot","title":"状态同步与快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/state-snapshot"},{"seq":3,"slug":"client-prediction","title":"客户端预测与协调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/client-prediction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"techniques","title":"核心技法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpolation-extrapolation","title":"插值与外推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/interpolation-extrapolation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lag-compensation","title":"延迟补偿与命中判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/lag-compensation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rollback-netcode","title":"回滚网络同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/techniques/rollback-netcode"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"infrastructure","title":"基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transport-protocols","title":"传输协议与可靠 UDP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/infrastructure/transport-protocols"},{"seq":2,"slug":"matchmaking-relay","title":"匹配、中继与 NAT 穿透","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/infrastructure/matchmaking-relay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-anticheat","title":"安全与反作弊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/infrastructure/security-anticheat"}]}]}